            "summary": "Activist investor Jana Partners has built a stake in  Cooper  Cos. and plans to push for strategic alternatives, including a potential deal to combine its contact-lens unit with rival  Bausch + Lomb  according to people familiar with the matter.  Jana also plans to push Cooper to make other changes that could help lift shares, including through improving capital allocation and returns, the people said.  The global medical-device manufacturer makes contact lenses and vision-care products through its CooperVision segment and provides products and services for women\u2019s health and fertility through CooperSurgical.",
